.TH ALI-GAME 1 "October 2026" "ALI Linux 1.4.2" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
ali-game \- run a game the ALI way: performance plus MangoHud
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ali-game
.I game-command...
.SH DESCRIPTION
Pins the performance governor, runs the game under MangoHud
(FPS overlay) when available, restores the normal governor on
exit. Pair with Game mode for silence from the town crier.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR ali-perf (1)
